              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"/>
                <path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-yellow-900 mb-3">Контакти и прекъсвачи</h3>
            <ul class="text-sm text-yellow-800 space-y-1">
              <li>• Монтаж на нови прекъсвачи</li>
              <li>• Смяна на стари прекъсвачи</li>
              <li>• Поставяне на контакти</li>
              <li>• Ремонт на контакти и прекъсвачи</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          
          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-amber-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-amber-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-amber-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/>
                <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="3"/>
                <line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="23"/>
                <line x1="4.22" y1="4.22" x2="5.64" y2="5.64"/>
                <line x1="18.36" y1="18.36" x2="19.78" y2="19.78"/>
                <line x1="1" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"/>
                <line x1="21" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12"/>
                <line x1="4.22" y1="19.78" x2="5.64" y2="18.36"/>
                <line x1="18.36" y1="5.64" x2="19.78" y2="4.22"/>
