            <ul class="text-sm text-orange-800 space-y-1">
              <li>• Нови електрически инсталации</li>
              <li>• Ремонт на инсталации</li>
              <li>• Смяна на кабели</li>
              <li>• Електрически табла</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-50 to-lime-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-lime-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-lime-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <rect width="16" height="10" x="4" y="7" rx="1" ry="1"/>
                <line x1="7" y1="19" x2="7" y2="21"/>
                <line x1="17" y1="19" x2="17" y2="21"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-lime-900 mb-3">Малки уреди</h3>
            <ul class="text-sm text-lime-800 space-y-1">
              <li>• Ремонт на малки уреди</li>
              <li>• Смяна на кабели</li>
              <li>• Ремонт на щепсели</li>
              <li>• Диагностика на устройства</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-red-50 to-red-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-red-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/>
                <line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/>
