              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-red-900 mb-3">Аварийни ремонти</h3>
            <ul class="text-sm text-red-800 space-y-1">
              <li>• Спешни електрически ремонти</li>
              <li>• Отстраняване на къси съединения</li>
              <li>• Възстановяване на тока</li>
              <li>• Аварийни ремонти на табла</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-emerald-100 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-shadow border border-emerald-200">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/>
                <path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-emerald-900 mb-3">Диагностика</h3>
            <ul class="text-sm text-emerald-800 space-y-1">
